n? Levántate, y clama a tu Dios; quizá él tendrá compasión de nosotros, y no pereceremos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"patrón","strong":"7227"},{"word":"nave","strong":"2259"},{"word":"le","strong":"413"},{"word":"acercó","strong":"7126"},{"word":"dijo","strong":"559"},{"word":"Qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"dormilón","strong":"7290"},{"word":"dormilón","strong":"6965"},{"word":"clama","strong":"7121"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"quizá","strong":"194"},{"word":"él","strong":"430"},{"word":"compasión","strong":"6245"},{"word":"nosotros","strong":"587"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"pereceremos","strong":"6"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y dijeron «cada uno» * a su compañero: Venid y echemos suertes, para que sepamos por causa de quién nos ha venido este mal. Y echaron suertes, y la suerte cayó sobre Jonás.","strongTokens":[{"word":"dijeron","strong":"559"},{"word":"*","strong":"376"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"compañero","strong":"7453"},{"word":"Venid","strong":"1980"},{"word":"echemos","strong":"5307"},{"word":"suertes","strong":"1486"},{"word":"sepamos","strong":"3045"},{"word":"sepamos","strong":"7945"},{"word":"sepamos","strong":"7451"},{"word":"sepamos","strong":"2063"},{"word":"quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"echaron","strong":"5307"},{"word":"suertes","strong":"1486"},{"word":"suerte","strong":"1486"},{"word":"cayó","strong":"5307"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"Jonás","strong":"3124"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Entonces le, dijeron ellos: Decláranos, ahora por qué nos ha venido este mal. ¿Qué oficio tienes, y de dónde vienes? ¿Cuál es tu tierra, y de qué pueblo eres?","strongTokens":[{"word":"le","strong":"413"},{"word":"dijeron","strong":"559"},{"word":"Decláranos","strong":"5046"},{"word":"ahora","strong":"4994"},{"word":"qué","strong":"834"},{"word":"venido","strong":"4310"},{"word":"venido","strong":"7451"},{"word":"venido","strong":"2063"},{"word":"Qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"oficio","strong":"4399"},{"word":"oficio","strong":"370"},{"word":"oficio","strong":"935"},{"word":"tienes","strong":"859"},{"word":"Cuál","strong":"4100"},{"word":"tu","strong":"859"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"335"},{"word":"de","strong":"2088"},{"word":"pueblo","strong":"5971"},{"word":"pueblo","strong":"859"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y él les, respondió: Soy hebreo, y temo a Jehová, Dios de los cielos, que hizo el mar y la tierra.","strongTokens":[{"word":"les","strong":"413"},{"word":"respondió","strong":"559"},{"word":"hebreo","strong":"5680"},{"word":"hebreo","strong":"595"},{"word":"temo","strong":"3373"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"430"},{"word":"cielos","strong":"8064"},{"word":"cielos","strong":"589"},{"word":"que","strong":"834"},{"word":"hizo","strong":"6213"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"3004"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y aquellos hombres temieron sobremanera, y le, dijeron: ¿Por qué has hecho esto? Porque ellos sabían que huía de la presencia de Jehová, pues él se lo había declarado.","strongTokens":[{"word":"hombres","strong":"582"},{"word":"hombres","strong":"3373"},{"word":"temieron","strong":"3372"},{"word":"temieron","strong":"3374"},{"word":"sobremanera","strong":"1419"},{"word":"le","strong":"413"},{"word":"dijeron","strong":"559"},{"word":"qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"hecho","strong":"6213"},{"word":"esto","strong":"2063"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"6440"},{"word":"sabían","strong":"3045"},{"word":"sabían","strong":"582"},{"word":"que","strong":"3588"},{"word":"que","strong":"1931"},{"word":"huía","strong":"1272"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"pues","strong":"3588"},{"word":"declarado","strong":"5046"},{"word":"declarado","strong":"1992"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":11,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y le, dijeron: ¿Qué haremos contigo para que el mar se nos, aquiete? Porque el mar se iba embraveciendo más y más.","strongTokens":[{"word":"le","strong":"413"},{"word":"dijeron","strong":"559"},{"word":"Qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"haremos","strong":"6213"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"nos","strong":"5921"},{"word":"aquiete","strong":"8367"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"iba","strong":"1980"},{"word":"embraveciendo","strong":"5590"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":12,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"El les, respondió: Tomadme y echadme al, mar, y el mar se os, aquietará; porque yo sé que por mi causa ha venido esta gran tempestad sobre vosotros.","strongTokens":[{"word":"les","strong":"413"},{"word":"respondió","strong":"559"},{"word":"Tomadme","strong":"5375"},{"word":"Tomadme","strong":"2904"},{"word":"al","strong":"413"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"os","strong":"5921"},{"word":"aquietará","strong":"8367"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"porque","strong":"7945"},{"word":"porque","strong":"5591"},{"word":"porque","strong":"1419"},{"word":"porque","strong":"2088"},{"word":"yo","strong":"589"},{"word":"sé","strong":"3045"},{"word":"que","strong":"3588"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":13,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y aquellos hombres trabajaron para hacer volver la nave a tierra; mas no pudieron, porque el mar se iba embraveciendo más y más contra ellos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"hombres","strong":"582"},{"word":"hombres","strong":"7725"},{"word":"trabajaron","strong":"2864"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"3004"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"pudieron","strong":"3201"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"iba","strong":"1980"},{"word":"embraveciendo","strong":"5590"},{"word":"ellos","strong":"5921"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":14,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Entonces clamaron a Jehová y dijeron: «Te rogamos» * ahora, Jehová, que no perezcamos nosotros por la vida de este hombre, ni pongas sobre nosotros la sangre inocente; porque tú, Jehová, has hecho como has querido.","strongTokens":[{"word":"clamaron","strong":"7121"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"dijeron","strong":"559"},{"word":"*","strong":"4994"},{"word":"ahora","strong":"577"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"no","strong":"408"},{"word":"perezcamos","strong":"6"},{"word":"vida","strong":"5315"},{"word":"vida","strong":"376"},{"word":"vida","strong":"2088"},{"word":"ni","strong":"408"},{"word":"pongas","strong":"5414"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"nosotros","strong":"587"},{"word":"sangre","strong":"1818"},{"word":"inocente","strong":"5355"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"tú","strong":"859"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"834"},{"word":"hecho","strong":"6213"},{"word":"querido","strong":"2654"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":15,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y tomaron a Jonás, y lo echaron al, mar; y el mar se aquietó de su furor.","strongTokens":[{"word":"tomaron","strong":"5375"},{"word":"Jonás","strong":"3124"},{"word":"Jonás","strong":"2904"},{"word":"al","strong":"413"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"aquietó","strong":"5975"},{"word":"furor","strong":"2197"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":1,"verse":16,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y temieron aquellos hombres a Jehová con gran temor, y ofrecieron sacrificio a Jehová, e hicieron votos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"temieron","strong":"3372"},{"wor