"strong":"8085"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Me echaste a lo profundo, en medio de los mares, Y me rodeó la corriente; Todas tus ondas y tus olas pasaron sobre mí.","strongTokens":[{"word":"echaste","strong":"7993"},{"word":"profundo","strong":"4688"},{"word":"medio","strong":"3824"},{"word":"mares","strong":"3220"},{"word":"rodeó","strong":"5437"},{"word":"corriente","strong":"5104"},{"word":"Todas","strong":"3605"},{"word":"ondas","strong":"4867"},{"word":"olas","strong":"1530"},{"word":"pasaron","strong":"5674"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Entonces dije: Desechado soy de delante de tus ojos; Mas aún veré tu santo templo.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Entonces","strong":"589"},{"word":"dije","strong":"559"},{"word":"Desechado","strong":"1644"},{"word":"delante","strong":"5048"},{"word":"ojos","strong":"5869"},{"word":"Mas","strong":"389"},{"word":"aún","strong":"3254"},{"word":"aún","strong":"5027"},{"word":"tu","strong":"413"},{"word":"santo","strong":"6944"},{"word":"templo","strong":"1964"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Las aguas me rodearon hasta el alma, Rodeóme, el abismo; El alga se enredó a mi cabeza.","strongTokens":[{"word":"me","strong":"4325"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"661"},{"word":"el","strong":"5704"},{"word":"Rodeóme","strong":"5315"},{"word":"el","strong":"5437"},{"word":"El","strong":"8415"},{"word":"se","strong":"5488"},{"word":"a","strong":"2280"},{"word":"a","strong":"7218"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Descendí a los cimientos de los montes; La tierra echó sus cerrojos sobre mí para siempre; Mas tú sacaste mi vida de la sepultura, oh Jehová Dios mío.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Descendí","strong":"3381"},{"word":"cimientos","strong":"7095"},{"word":"montes","strong":"2022"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"},{"word":"cerrojos","strong":"1280"},{"word":"mí","strong":"1157"},{"word":"siempre","strong":"5769"},{"word":"sacaste","strong":"5927"},{"word":"vida","strong":"2416"},{"word":"sepultura","strong":"7845"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"430"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Cuando mi alma desfallecía en mí, me acordé de Jehová, Y mi oración llegó hasta ti en tu santo templo.","strongTokens":[{"word":"alma","strong":"5315"},{"word":"desfallecía","strong":"5848"},{"word":"en","strong":"5921"},{"word":"acordé","strong":"2142"},{"word":"acordé","strong":"935"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"oración","strong":"8605"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"413"},{"word":"en","strong":"413"},{"word":"santo","strong":"6944"},{"word":"templo","strong":"1964"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Los que siguen vanidades ilusorias, Su misericordia abandonan.","strongTokens":[{"word":"ilusorias","strong":"8104"},{"word":"ilusorias","strong":"1892"},{"word":"Su","strong":"7723"},{"word":"abandonan","strong":"2617"},{"word":"abandonan","strong":"5800"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Mas yo con voz de alabanza te ofreceré sacrificios; Pagaré lo que prometí. La salvación es de Jehová.","strongTokens":[{"word":"yo","strong":"589"},{"word":"voz","strong":"6963"},{"word":"alabanza","strong":"8426"},{"word":"ofreceré","strong":"2076"},{"word":"Pagaré","strong":"7999"},{"word":"que","strong":"834"},{"word":"prometí","strong":"5087"},{"word":"salvación","strong":"3444"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"}]},{"bookId":"JON","chapter":2,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y mandó Jehová al pez, y vomitó a Jonás en tierra.","strongTokens":[{"word":"mandó","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","stron